    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n6987" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀνάμεσος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>in the midst, in the heart
				of a country,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πόλεις ἀνάμεσοι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hdt.
					2.108
				</span></i>
			; simply, <i>in the midst, between,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				PLond.
				2.267.189
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χρόνος ἀ. ἡμέρας καὶ νυκτός</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Eudox.
					<u>Ars</u>
					16
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὴν ἀνάμεσον ἀλλήλων χώραν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ph.Byz.
					<u>Mir.</u>
					1.2
				</span></i>
			.</div>
